# The debugger preview's demo target (DBG-001): live data for CuBit.Debug to
# read. It links the cooperative stub (CuBit.Debug_Stub) and registers the
# debug-target service, so a debugger that requests that service may attach;
# the stub shares its pages read-only with that debugger, and its threads
# park at their checkpoints when asked. No secrets live here.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.debug-demo"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    # The declared debug port: registering debug-target (procmgr lets only
    # this identity hold the role in the preview).
    (notification "debug-target" Notify_Access.Manage "registration")
    # ABI-002: its debug text (CuBit.Console_Route).
    (service "logstore" "logstore")]
  optional => ["logstore"])
